<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "luxr" .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "luxR repressor/activator,  (no LVA?)" .
