<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#mutableProvenance> "<em>V. fischeri</em> <genbank>AF170104</genbank>" .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#topLevel> <https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#ownedBy> <https://synbiohub.org/user/james> .
