<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/igem#sampleStatus> "In stock" .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/igem#status> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/igem#status/Available> .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#bookmark> "false" .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#mutableNotes> "<P> <P>2 silent point mutants were introduced in the coding sequence to remove internal      XbaI and PstI sites. Mutation sites were chosen to replace codons commonly      used in <em>E. coli</em> with codons used at a similar frequency. <P>" .
<https://synbiohub.org/public/igem/BBa_C0062/1> <http://wiki.synbiohub.org/wiki/Terms/synbiohub#star> "true" .
